   <text:p text:style-name="P1">Miguel Bernal Marin</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P2"><text:s text:c="53"/></text:p>
   <table:table table:name="Tabla1" table:style-name="Tabla1">
    <table:table-column table:style-name="Tabla1.A" table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="Tabla1.1">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Tabla1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P22"><text:span text:style-name="T2">+52 </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">33 0000 0000</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Tabla1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P3">miguel.bernal.marin@gmail.com</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="Tabla1.1">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Tabla1.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P6">https://www.linkedin.com/in/miguelinux/</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Tabla1.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P7"><text:s/>https://github.com/miguelinux/</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
   </table:table>
   <text:h text:style-name="P23" text:outline-level="1"><text:span text:style-name="T3"><text:s text:c="333"/></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">OBJECTIVE</text:span></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P24"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P32">Senior Software Engineer</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P48"/>
   <text:h text:style-name="P9" text:outline-level="1">SUMMARY</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P63"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P64">• Highly skilled professional with a proven track record of over 15 years in Linux system administration and engineering, including programming (C/C++, Python, Java), web development (HTML, CSS, JavaScript), automation and scripting (DevOps), project packaging (RPM, DEB), and IT troubleshooting.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P64"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P64">• Knowledge of container management (Docker, Podman, LXC) and virtual machines (Qemu/KVM), and use of various commercial cloud providers (AWS, Google Cloud, Azure).</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P64"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P64">• Experience contributing using GIT to free and open source software projects, compiling and modifying the Linux kernel, using various Linux distributions, and automating software processes.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P64"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P64">• Shared expertise across national and international audiences by teaching specialized courses and presentation, with a focus on mentoring and training technical staff and the general public.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P64"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P64">• Skilled in managing software projects with the latest cloud technologies.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P64"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P64">• Member of the Mexican National System of Researchers (SNII) with several published articles and patents. Professor of undergraduate and graduate programs at various universities.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P33"/>
   <text:h text:style-name="P9" text:outline-level="1">EXPERIENCE</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P24"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P26"><text:span text:style-name="T12">Intel</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T11">,</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T5">Zapopan</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">, </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T5">M</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T6">e</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T5">xico</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"><text:tab/></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T12">2011 - 2025</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P8">Linux OS Engineering Area</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P28" text:outline-level="2"><text:span text:style-name="T6">OS Development Engineer</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">, </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T14">2021 – 2025</text:span></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P11">Enabling the new Intel key features on Debian Linux kernel package and create CentOS packages for testing.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P55"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P19">• 18+ contribution to the Debian Linux kernel package.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P19">• Enabling 3 internal validation tools to be able to run on Debian.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P56">• Developed a Python application that accelerated deployment time by 50% by automatically </text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P56"><text:span text:style-name="T31"><text:s text:c="2"/>c</text:span>onfiguring the system under test (SUT) .</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P19">• Wrote Bash scripts to automate container configuration for project development and testing.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P19">• Build internal CentOS packages and automating them using GitHub Actions.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P19"/>
   <text:h text:style-name="P28" text:outline-level="2"><text:span text:style-name="T8">S</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T9">oftware </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T8">Engineer</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">, </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T15">2014</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T13"> – </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T15">2021</text:span></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P29"><text:span text:style-name="T15">Leader of the Linux kernel package development and maintenance team from the Clear Linux distribution.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P29"><text:span text:style-name="T15"/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P58">• Fully automated (without human intervention) the update of six</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P58"><text:s text:c="2"/>kernel packages for the Clear Linux distribution.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P58">• Trained and developed my team&apos;s Linux knowledge.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P58">• Maintained and enabled several packages for the Clear Linux distribution.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P58">• Contribute to open source projects for include Clear Linux OS structure.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P58"/>
   <text:h text:style-name="P28" text:outline-level="2"><text:soft-page-break/><text:span text:style-name="T10">Graphics Software Engineer</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">, </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T17">2011</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T13"> – </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T17">2014</text:span></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P13">Developer and tester for Intel graphics cards using virtualization and Microsoft WHQL.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P13"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P13">• Automated graphics validation using Linux scripts, reducing workload by 70%.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P13">• Intel graphics cards tester on Android platforms.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P13">• Use the Microsoft DirectX 9 testing API and the WHQL to develop and testing.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P15"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P16"/>
   <text:h text:style-name="P17" text:outline-level="1">EDUCATION</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P30"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P42"><text:span text:style-name="T19">PhD. in Electric Engineering</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T18"><text:tab/></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T20">20</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T21">1</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T18">2</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P34"><text:span text:style-name="T28">Study area</text:span>: <text:span text:style-name="T28">Robotics and computer vision.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P36"><text:span text:style-name="T28">Research stay</text:span>: Fraunhofer IITB <text:span text:style-name="T28">Institute</text:span>, Karlsruhe, <text:span text:style-name="T28">Germany</text:span>, 2008</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P37">Research and Advanced Study Center from IPN (CINVESTAV)</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P44"><text:span text:style-name="T22"/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P43"><text:span text:style-name="T19">M.Sc. in Electric Engineering</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T18"><text:tab/></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T20">20</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T18">0</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T21">7</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P35"><text:span text:style-name="T28">Study area</text:span>: <text:span text:style-name="T28">Robotics and computer vision.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P37">Research and Advanced Study Center from IPN (CINVESTAV)</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P45"><text:span text:style-name="T22"/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P47"><text:span text:style-name="T24">Bachelor’s Degree in Mathematics</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T23"><text:tab/></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T25">20</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T26">02</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P34"><text:span text:style-name="T29">Specialization</text:span>: <text:span text:style-name="T29">Math computing </text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P34">Guadalajara’<text:span text:style-name="T29">s University</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P46"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P27"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">LANGUAGES</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P24"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P38">Spanish: Native</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P39"><text:span text:style-name="T30">English</text:span>: <text:span text:style-name="T30">Fluent</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P39"><text:span text:style-name="T30">German</text:span>: <text:span text:style-name="T30">Basic</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P38"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P46"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P5"><text:span text:style-name="T30">ADDITIONAL INFORMATION</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P5"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P67">• Talks and presentations at various conferences/meetings as: Linux Cabal, KCD, CCOSS, FSL, PosaDev, GUGLAG, </text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P67"><text:s text:c="3"/>Pythonistas GDL, U de G, SSJ, Bsides Guadalajara.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P67">• Open source contributions: Linux kernel, systemd, Debian Linux kernel package, ndctl, Intel QPL, various Clear</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P67"><text:s text:c="3"/>Linux packages, including the Linux kernel package.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P66">• Publications: Articles in specialized journals and conferences, book chapters.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P66">• Professional Associations: Member of the IEEE.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P66">• US patents: 10,609,205 B2, 10,938,977 B2, 11,516,336 B2.</text:p>
